        StaticBook("Edgy Alphabet", "JJKoshane", "A is for apple which might be poisonous.\n\nB is for blood which you love to spill.\n\nC is for culinary arts which are not your run of the mill...\n\nD is for dark which is a way to explain your past.\nE is for eternal which your suffering is.\n\nF is for fire which will turn your enemies to ash.\n\nG is for greed which corrupts us all.\n\nH is for horrible which is one way to describe how you feel.\nI is for internal where your pain resides.\n\nJ is for jugular which is an easy target... usually.\n\nK is for killing which you love to do.\n\n\nL is for luck which those who cross your path and live to tell the tale have.\n\nM is for monster which is how you see yourself.\n\nN is for negative which is what you are often considered.\nO is for offense which is the best defense.\n\nP is for pestilence which you pray for everyday.\n\nQ is for questionable which is what some consider your methods.\nR is for roaming which is what you do.\n\nS is for strike which you do from behind.\n\nT is for testicles which is a favorite target.\n\nU is for unfit to live which is what you believe most are.\nV is for vulture which picks the remains of your prey.\n\nW is for world which you want to destroy.\n\nX is for... I got nothing... moving on.\n\nY is for youth which is a common target.\nZ is for... I am at a loss again... damnit.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n                       FIN\n\nI wonder who want want this book...", ""),
        StaticBook("Edible Flowers", "Teerz", "Edible Flowers\n\n*Only eat petals if this sign is shown.\nAngelica\n\nGood with fish and steps are good candied.\n\nTaste like Celery.\nAnise Hyssop\n\nTastes sweet like licorice.\nApple\n\nDelicate floral flavor\nArugula\n\nNutty or spicey almost pepper flavor.\nBee Balm\n\nTastes like earl gray when made into tea.\nBorage and Burnet\n\nBoth taste like cucumbers.\nCalendule *\n\nTastes spicy, tangy and peppery.  Turns foods golden.\nCarnation\n\nApple like flavor, good for tea.\nChamomile *\n\nTastes similar to apple, good for tea.\nChrystanthemum *\n\nTastes slightly bitter with a pungent aroma.\n\n\nCoriander\n\nSoapy like flavor.\n\nCornflower * \n\nSweet and spicy, clover like flavor.\nDandelion *\n\nBuds are good fried in butter, tastes like mushrooms.   \n\nGood for wine.\nDay Lily\n\nTastes sweet like lettuce leaves, tastes slightly like chestnuts or beans.\nGladiolus*\n\nTastes like lettuce\nHibiscus\n\nStamens are bitter.\n\nTastes unique, makes a good drink when boiled.\nHollyhock\n\nTastes very bland.\nImpatiens\n\nBland flavor.\nJasmine\n\nDelicate sweet flavor, great for tea.\nJonny Jump up\n\nTastes sweet almost bland.\nLavender\n\nTastes floral, slightly perfumey.\nLilac\n\nLemony floral flavor.\nMallow\n\nSweet delicate flavor\nMiragold\n\nSpicy and even bitter.\nOkra\n\nTastes similar to Squash blossoms.\nPansy\n\nvery mild sweet and tart flavor.\nPinapple Guava\n\nSimilar to ripe fruit, flavorful.\nPrimrose\n\nSweet almost bland like flavor.\n\n\nRadish\n\nMild sweeter version of the radish plant.\nRedbud\n\nMildly sweet flavor.\nRose\n\nAromatic Flavor.\nRosemary\n\nPinelike flavor, sweet and savory.\nRunner Bean\n\nNectar, bean like flavor.\nScented Geranium\n\nTastes similar to lemon or mint.\nSnapdragon\n\nBland almost bitter flavor.\nSociety Garlic\n\nMild garlic flavor.\nSquash Blossom\n\nSweet nectar flavor.\nSunflower\n\nSlightly bitter flavor.\nThyme\n\nTastes like lemon.\nTuberous\n\nSour crisp almost lemon flavor.\nViolet\n\nNectar like flavor.\nYucca *\n\nCrunchy fresh flavor.", ""),
