        StaticBook("Gray Bard's Song", "Grungron Irongut", "    The Grey Bards\n           Song\n-------------------The father journeys far away\n\nThe children left behind\n\nThe children now to rule themselves\n\nNo father there to mind\nThe child of light creates the stars\n\nHis countless friends to tend him\n\nThe child of fire creates the sun\n\nTo drive away night time sin\n\n\nThe child of night creates the moon\n\nIts lonely light his sign\n\nThe father comes from far away, his journey at its end\n\nThe children gather 'round his throne\n\nHis glory theirs to tend\nThe child of light approaches first\n\nHis father turns away\n\nThe child of fire sees his light, may he be now in dismay\n\nThe child of night there lingers on, the transgression his to mend\nThe father now yearns long for sleep, his heart filled with great sadness\n\nThe children flee to their creations, seeking comfort in their kindness\n\nThe child of light calls forth the stars, his company be aenguls\nThe child of fire divides the sun, its fragments called the Daemons\n\nThe child of night brings forth the moon to drive away the madness\n\nThe children three now lost to time\nTheir glory sealed onto their signs\n\nThe childrens children linger on \n\nThe children third compose their song\n\nThe father now sleeps, his rest sublime \n\nHe hopes to forgive his childrens crime\nThe father journeys far away\n\nThe children left behind\n-------------------Composed by the Gray Bard\n\nRecorded by\n\n-Grungron Irongut", ""),
        StaticBook("Green & Sleep", "Annabella", "The healing ability of Cactus Green baked into foods.\n\nVol. 1; Sleep issues\nShould my hypothesis be correct this will become an entire series.\nThe testing will be on a number of paitents who have issues sleeping, they will be given cactus green bread after passing a series of questions deeming them fit for testing.\nUpon my interviews with the citizens of Gimblewood I was told most always smoke pipeweed, a much weaker form and sleeping issues are un heard of within the community.\nPreperation: In order to have a proper test one must keep all variables but one the exact same. For this reason the test will be done within the home of the subject. To avoid them fearing I will tamper with their body I will also pay for installation of a\ndoor lock, given the door has a window of some sort so I may view the subject's activity. The bread which has the Cactus green in it will be of a high consentrate to ensure the test works.\nSide note: Cactus green which is smoked harms more than it could possibly help. Cactus green MUST be baked for proper bennefits. Smoked cactus green might help sleep, but it hurts lung capacity.\n Subject 1:\nSubject 1 claims to stay awake for 3 hours just laying in bed before they fall asleep. After a test with no green to make sure the claims are indeed true. The next evening I fed Subject 1 the bread, they had the typical  symtoms of cactus gree\nn. After the inital laughing stage the subject went to their bed, and lied there for roughly 45 minutes rather than 3 hours. The subject woke up on the time they typically do, giving them 2 hours and 15 minutes more sleep than normal.\nSubject 2:\nSubject 2 is different, they had no problem getting to sleep, however they woke up often through the night. Upon testing their claims Subject 2 woke up 5 times for 15 minutes, leading to an hour and 15 minutes of sleep loss.\nAs they were fed the Cactus green bread they acted similar to Subject 1, and went to bed after the initial laughing stage. During the night I recorded 1 time where they woke up for roughly 15 minutes, leading to an overall more fufilling sleep.\nConclusion: The Hypothesis that Cactus green would help sleep was a sucess. Both subjects expirenced a boost in sleep, and woke up at the times they typically do.\nSide notes: Both subjects have only tried cactus green a few times in their life, and are not regular users. Regular users may have to use a higher concentrate. \n\nOne should not use this every night, but rather the nights they feel \nsleep is not an option as it is a known fact that Cactus green is a substance which you must use more of to get the same feeling. This can get quite expensive if done every night. IT is recomended that cactus green is not used more than once a week.\n------++{_}++------\n      This book is\n        Property\n          Of the\n         Eternal\n         Library\n------++{_}++------", ""),
        StaticBook("Greyhame History", "Ser Eddard \"Ned\" Greyhame", "Story of the house Greyhame.\n\nPart 1\n\nEverything started, during the Phoenix Revolution when ser Ulfric Greyhame the first was ordered to raise a force, big enough to hold the enemy front as he did\nat the end. At one of his many battles his force which was the regiment of the Rangers, very skilled men in the knowledge of both of the bow and the terrain knowledge. And this is the most important reason of their survival in that battle, they managed to\nambush each other's enemy front and have managed to declare victory in the field of battle. Ulfric Greyhame I was the hero of that battle and the reason is that, he was calm enough to give orders that brought victory. He was rewarded with land, the land \n\nof old fort named Dunaf, a fort which was made inside the core of a mountain not far from the human lands. Ulfric Greyhame I was and his veteran now rangers were ordered to keep the boarders safe from enemy and bandit forces and they managed to do so.\nOld fort Dunaf along with the rangers were both the legacy of the Greyhames. Two generations after Ulfric Greyhame I the veteran, Eraborn and Faramith Greyhame took the charge of the Imperial Phoenix rangers and fort Dunaf, both have managed\nto upgrade the fort and the rangers and kept the boarders safe from Aesterwald. Untill one day, the lord who were under has rebelled against Oren and the Carrions. They were stripped from land, titles and the most important, the rangers. They were assumed\nas traitors. Years later, Ulfric II Greyhame son of Eraborn has managed to reform the rangers and managed to get knighted from lord Augustus Winchester and fought to bring the house Greyhame back to it's glory and legacy. But it was too late.\nFort Dunaf was destroyed from lord Horen to build his new city and castle. Ulfric Greyhame II was forced to change his name to Eddard to keep low profile against his enemies who were many, because they were jeallous of his regiment\nand wealth. Eddard was forced to close the Regiment sadly because he had no where to estalbish the rangers. Winchesters were gone so did Eddard, Faramith, Harkat and Eorden Greyhame. Many years later Eddard finds out that his father and uncle were both \nkilled but managed to regroup the remaining Greyhames to start over once more and bring house Greyhame back to it's former glory and wealth. They hold a brand new castle, named it after their old castle, Dunaf and will run once more the rangers.\nSigned by: Eddard Greyhame, the Patriarch of house Greyhame.\n\nDate: 3rd of Snow's Maiden, 1499.", ""),
        StaticBook("Ground Logic", "Jeth", "From my research, I've come to the conclusion that Thunder or more commonly called Lighting, is a powerful flow of uncontrollable energy. It is formed in the sky and once \"Charged\" enough, will strike anywhere it finds a conduit. A conduit can be anything\nbut some materials like iron and copper, seem to be better at conducting the intensity. The sound of explosion (Lighting hitting the ground and setting it on fire) always come after the visual peeking of the lighting. In other words, energy travels faster\nthan sound itself. That may not seem a lot, but it is quite a lot. \n-------------------After thinking about it, for hours and hours... I've come to the conclusion that I can prevent fires caused by lightning by setting a powerful device that would attract\nthe lightning toward itself (instead of our houses) and would neutralise the energy itself. If you think that the energy is moving at a... let's say \"A\" speed and it's power would be rated by \"P\" and without Power, there wouldn't be any intensity (A) then\none cannot be without the other. \n-------------------No, no, no, no! Something's no right. Power and intensity can't be working if there isn't something to transport the energy. A material, something to resist it. A resistance... Yes!\nA resistance could be called... \"R\". Therefore we know that the Power equals the amount of intensity moving inside a resistance. Which means... P(v)=I(A)xR(rl). With this simple formula, I should be able to control it.\n*DRAWING OF A PROTOTYPE*\n\n(((  http://imgur.com/4tpakIu  )))\n\n\n\n\n\n\nP(v)=I(A)x R(rl)", ""),
