        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Fáoláín Silk - Red Wine§0\n§0\n§0Soft, Velvety tannin and bold blackberry flavour.§0\n§0\n§0Price - 10 mina\n\nMandragora Tea§0\n§0\n§0Feels warms as it flows well, quickly seeming to rejuvinate and bring the body back to life.§0\n§0\n§0Price - 1 mina\n\nDwarf's Pumpkin Ale§0\n§0\n§0A drink of a strong Orange color, with an intensifying sour flavor. The scent is strong as well, filling the nostrils of the drinker in acidic ways.§0\n§0\n§0Price - 4 minas\n\nBlood Ale§0\n§0\n§0A red colored, but seethrough ale. It has a bit of salt added, and a metalic flavor, making some people mistake the flavor for blood. It doesn't create much foam.§0\n§0\n§0Price - 6 minas\n\nApple Mead§0\n§0\n§0Yellow apple brewed drink, with a strong aroma of the fruit. Expertly brewed by halflings.§0\n§0\n§0Price - 3 minas", ""),
