        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Day 1\nWe hold at the fort of Baron De Montfort. A hoard of Aesterwald and Renascum are preparing to siege us. We may be surrounded.\n\n\nDay 4\nNone have come. I anxiously await the siege. Many have been\n\nsent out as raiding parties. Few return. Our numbers run thin. It is too late to run.", ""),
